<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">cleansing-wave</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Cleansing Wave</ansi> spell sends a purifying pulse of Chrysalis energy
outward in all directions, neutralizing poisons and afflictions in
every ally it washes over. An essential tool in any group facing
venomous or toxic enemies.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast cleansing-wave</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Area
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Vital
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 10
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 80
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Purges poisons from all allies in the room

